1
00:00:00,200 --> 00:00:02,800
It is watching me.

2
00:00:03,000 --> 00:00:05,600
Not on a timer.

3
00:00:05,800 --> 00:00:08,600
There is a camera
under the eye.

4
00:00:08,800 --> 00:00:11,400
It finds my face.

5
00:00:11,600 --> 00:00:14,400
No Pi. No PC.
No wifi.

6
00:00:14,600 --> 00:00:17,400
Two wires.
That is the whole link.

7
00:00:17,600 --> 00:00:20,400
The blinks are its own.

8
00:00:20,600 --> 00:00:23,400
$64 of parts.

9
00:00:23,600 --> 00:00:26,400
A second eye
is under $12.

10
00:00:26,600 --> 00:00:29,400
None of this
was the point.

11
00:00:29,600 --> 00:00:32,600
A sensor I needed
went out of production.

12
00:00:32,800 --> 00:00:35,400
So I built this.

13
00:00:35,600 --> 00:00:38,500
My robot IRIS
runs it now.
